      "citation_path": "us/rulemaking/federal-register/2025-12-01/2025-21671",
      "metadata": {
        "abstract": "In prior notices, the U.S. Trade Representative modified the actions in the Section 301 investigation of China's acts, policies, and practices related to technology transfer, intellectual property, and innovation by excluding from additional duties certain products of China. This notice announces the U.S. Trade Representative's determination to extend the 178 current exclusions.",
